units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
lattice fcc 1
region box block 0 1 0 1 0 1 units lattice
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
replicate 10 10 10
mass 1 58.693
pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Ni
neighbor 2 bin
neigh_modify delay 10 every 1
timestep 0.001
velocity all create 600 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step temp press etotal pe ke vol
fix 1 all npt temp 300 2500 1 iso 1 1 10
run v_nsteps
